cfg.smithing_table.automation=Automation
cfg.smithing_table.automation.tooltip=Whether items may be inserted into or extracted from a smithing table, aka "IItemHandler support".\n- Any extraction will automatically perform the recipe and extract the resulting item(s).\n- Non-output items cannot be extracted, to make automation require no item filters.\n- Only accepts items that are valid for a recipe, and automatically puts them into the correct slots.
